window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When I tumbled into Wonderland, I only wanted to escape the epic mess my life had become. I'm not sure I can trust anything in this bizarre, intoxicating place.</p> <p>But the three enticing men I've just met might need me even more than anyone back home ever has—and somehow I feel like I belong in this strange world. I'm connected to the powers here in ways I barely understand.</p> <p>Too bad the Queen of Hearts won't give me time to unearth my hidden magic. She's coming for all our heads, and she's particularly eager to claim mine.</p> <p>How can I save my new lovers and their rebellion before everything I counted on turns completely upside down?</p> <p>The Looking-Glass Curse is a medium-burn reverse harem series that reimagines <i>Alice in Wonderland</i>. If you love spirited heroines, hot men with secrets to spare, and worlds full of unexpected delights and horrors, step through the looking-glass today!</p> <p>This complete series set contains all three books in the Looking-Glass Curse Trilogy—<i>Wicked Wonderland</i>, <i>Wrathful Wonderland</i>, and <i>Wanton Wonderland</i>—as well as three exclusive bonus scenes!</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
